UID:da9df8ab98e5f6611c4ba971f3b51472@jccc.on.ca
DESCRIPTION:Friendship through Culture (2026) / 文化がわかる。心
 がかよう。 (2026) JCCC Community Arts Exhibition The Japanese Canadia
 n Cultural Centre is pleased to present Friendship Through Culture (2026)\
 , a community arts exhibition reflecting on the evolving meanings of a phr
 ase that has long shaped Japanese Canadian cultural life. This year’s ex
 hibition explores the evolving meanings of a phrase that has long shaped J
 apanese Canadian cultural life. What first emerged as a gentle expression 
 of survival and resilience in the face of discrimination has shifted over 
 time into an open\, if complex\, practice of belonging. Today\, Friendship
  Through Culture (2026) carries multiple potential interpretations—diasp
 oric\, generational\, newly arrived\, and hybrid—and asks us how culture
  can both preserve memory and create new ways of living together. Exhibiti
 on Dates: March 1 – May 29\, 2026 The exhibition features original works
  across a range of media\, including painting\, photography\, textiles\, s
 culpture\, installation\, video\, and craft. Browse Works: Works 1 - 60 Wo
 rks 61 - 139 Full List of Artists: Select the Artists name to be taken dir
 ectly to their work Zere Abylgazina David Akio Asai Asobu Art Collective L
 aura Beaton Janice Mende Bennink David Bernhard Connie Bist Myroslava Boik
 iv Declan Boushy Diana Bullock Elena Butkov Marilena Isacescu Carlea Chris
  Corridore Barbara Eguchi Lindsay Erdman Alana Keiko Fleming Elaine Hameli
 n-Mitchell | Rosso Art & Design Steven Hasegawa Hyedie Hashimoto Deborah H
 atanaka Tibi Hegyesi Kentaro Imoto Neli Iordanova Ruth A. Mora Izturriaga 
 Lakshmi Preethi Kamak Kioni Amy Lee Tsutao Machida Mihoko Maeno Carin Kata
 giri Mahon Michael Marcynuk Betty Mochizuki Stephen North Mariana I. Padil
 la Electra Pappa Maryam Pazooki Nancy Peng Karen Perlmutter Tamiko Potts M
 ichelle Ramos Mio Reynolds Riki Robottobani Karen Sekikawa 関河カレン
  Keiko Shintani Thomas.A. Sokoloski SOWL Brenda Spielmann Ken Sugamori Man
 abu Takaishi Jerrold Tanaka Mui-Ling Teh Beverley Thum Yuki Tokita Weichan
  Wang Ebru Winegard Rita Wong Queenie Xu Deniz Yilmaz Ryo Yonekawa Yu Zhan
  Zhang\n\nCategories: Community Event\, Heritage\, JCCC Gallery\, Exhibiti
 on
LOCATION:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
URL:https://jccc.on.ca/event/2026/03/friendship-through-culture
X-SOURCE:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
