BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Go Team Japan! Soccer Public Viewings at the JCCC
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260612T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260625T220000
UID:8798afe79128c82d1a02bcc2d58cd595@jccc.on.ca
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready for a summer of soccer? Cheer on Team Japan at 3
  watch parties at the JCCC this June! The JCCC is proud to collaborate wit
 h J Athletics Canada to host public viewings of Japan at this summer’s t
 ournament as they take on the Netherlands\, Tunisia\, and Sweden. Bring yo
 ur friends and family to celebrate a summer of soccer in a fun\, community
  atmosphere. Each event will feature a variety of activities including int
 eractive games\, raffle prizes\, a beer garden\, and food and marketplace 
 vendors. Admission is free for all games\, and everyone is welcome to join
 ! Join us at the JCCC as we support Team Japan! Stay tuned for more detail
 s and we’ll see you there! Event Schedule Game 1: Japan vs. Netherlands 
 Sunday June 14\, 2026 Activities & vendors: 12:00 PM Kick-off: 4:00 PM Gam
 e 2: Japan vs. Tunisia Saturday June 20 / Sunday June 21\, 2026 Activities
  & vendors: 9:00 PM (June 20) Kick-off: 12:00 AM (MIDNIGHT June 21) Game 3
 : Japan vs. Sweden Thursday June 25\, 2026 Activities & vendors: 4:00 PM K
 ick-off: 7:00 PM\n\nCategories: Community Event
LOCATION:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
URL:https://jccc.on.ca/event/2026/06/go-team-japan-soccer-public-viewings-
 jccc
X-SOURCE:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
